Rudyard Kipling ya iku juru tulis, penyair, jurnalis.
Lair ana &lt;a href="Bombay"&gt;Bombay&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;, tanggal &lt;a href="30"&gt;30&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1865"&gt;1865&lt;/a&gt;.
Séda ana &lt;a href="Middlesex%20Hospital"&gt;Middlesex Hospital&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="London"&gt;London&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;, tanggal &lt;a href="18"&gt;18&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Januari"&gt;Januari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1936"&gt;1936&lt;/a&gt;.
Dhèwèké sinau ana United Services College, Westward Ho, Bideford, Inggris lan bali India taun &lt;a href="1882"&gt;1882&lt;/a&gt;, makarya ana koran Anglo-India.
Sepuluh taun lebare, dhèwèké mbojo karo &lt;a href="Caroline%20Balestier"&gt;Caroline Balestier&lt;/a&gt; lan omah-omah ana Brattleboro, Vermont.
Ing kana, dhèwèké nulis The Jungle Book taun &lt;a href="1894"&gt;1894&lt;/a&gt; kang kondhang.
Nalika Perang Donya 1, dhèwèké nulis manéka buku propaganda.
Kumpulan geguritané terbit taun 1933.
Taun &lt;a href="1907"&gt;1907&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké wntuk pahargyan &lt;a href="Nobel%20Sastra"&gt;Nobel Sastra&lt;/a&gt;.
Kipling uga dadi panampa manéka gelar kehormatan lan pahargyan liyané.
Taun &lt;a href="1926"&gt;1926&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké éntuk the Gold Medal of the Royal Society of Literature.
