Toni Morrison

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Chloe Anthony Wofford utawa kondhang minangka Toni Morrison ya iku sastrawan, juru tulis Amérika.
Kondhang amarga tulisané ngenani pengalaman wong kulit ireng, mligi wong wedhok kulit ireng, ana komunitas wong kulit ireng.&lt;ref name="RK bc"&gt;
Dhèwèké nampa pahargyan &lt;a href="Nobel%20Sastra"&gt;Nobel Sastra&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1993"&gt;1993&lt;/a&gt;.
Lair ana &lt;a href="Lorain"&gt;Lorain&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ohio"&gt;Ohio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, tanggal &lt;a href="18"&gt;18&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="F%C3%A8bruari"&gt;Fèbruari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1931"&gt;1931&lt;/a&gt;.
Dhèwèké sinau humaniora ana &lt;a href="Howard"&gt;Howard&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Cornell%20Universities"&gt;Cornell Universities&lt;/a&gt;, banjur makarya ana donya akademik ana &lt;a href="Texas%20Southern%20University"&gt;Texas Southern University&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Howard%20University"&gt;Howard University&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yale"&gt;Yale&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Princeton%20University"&gt;Princeton University&lt;/a&gt;.
Dhèwèké uga makarya minangka edhitor kanggo &lt;a href="Random%20House"&gt;Random House&lt;/a&gt;.
Dhèwèké wiwitan dadi novelis taun &lt;a href="1970"&gt;1970&lt;/a&gt;.
Cepet olehe kedelok, éntuk kritik lan éntuk akèh pamaca amarga epik, dhialog kang gampang, puitis, lan gambaran ekpresif wong Amérika Ireng.
Dhèwèké dadi anggota the American Academy of Arts and Letters kawit &lt;a href="1981"&gt;1981&lt;/a&gt;.
Entuk manéka pahargyan, salah sijiné &lt;a href="Pulitzer%20Prize"&gt;Pulitzer Prize&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1988"&gt;1988&lt;/a&gt;.
