<doc id="134218" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=134218" title="Patrick White">
Patrick White

Patrick Victor Martindale White utawa Patrick White yaiku novelis, dramawan &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;.
Lair ana &lt;a href="London"&gt;London&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;, tanggal &lt;a href="28"&gt;28&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="M%C3%A8i"&gt;Mèi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1912"&gt;1912&lt;/a&gt;.
Séda ana &lt;a href="Sydney"&gt;Sydney&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="New%20South%20Wales"&gt;New South Wales&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;, tanggal &lt;a href="30"&gt;30&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="September"&gt;September&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1990"&gt;1990&lt;/a&gt;.
Dhèwèké éntuk pahargyan &lt;a href="Nobel%20Sastra"&gt;Nobel Sastra&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1973"&gt;1973&lt;/a&gt;.
Dhèwèké sinau basa modern ana &lt;a href="King%27s%20College"&gt;King's College&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cambridge"&gt;Cambridge&lt;/a&gt;.
Dhèwèké nerbitake pakaryan, dolan, lan mèlu teater, saliyané nyambi ana &lt;a href="Royal%20Air%20Force"&gt;Royal Air Force&lt;/a&gt; nalika &lt;a href="Perang%20Donya%202"&gt;Perang Donya 2&lt;/a&gt;.
Lebar &lt;a href="1945"&gt;1945&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké bali ing &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;, nanging kala-kala uga ana &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;.
Happy Valley, novèl sepisanane taun &lt;a href="1939"&gt;1939&lt;/a&gt;, dicritakake ana New South Wales lan nudhuhake pengaruhe &lt;a href="D.%20H.%20Lawrence"&gt;D. H. Lawrence&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Thomas%20Hardy"&gt;Thomas Hardy&lt;/a&gt;.
Sabanjure, isi novèlé carita Australia, nanging olahane ora kebatesan sak nagara utawa sak jaman baé.
Dhèwèké mandheng Australia minangka nagara kang rikat ngrembakake dhiri, lan novèl-novèlé njajahi kemungkinan laku biadab ana manéka konteks.
Konsepsine ngenani Australia ana ing The Tree of Man taun &lt;a href="1955"&gt;1955&lt;/a&gt;, Voss taun &lt;a href="1957"&gt;1957&lt;/a&gt;, Riders in the Chariot taun &lt;a href="1961"&gt;1961&lt;/a&gt;. The Solid Mandala taun &lt;a href="1966"&gt;1966&lt;/a&gt;, lan The Twyborn Affair taun &lt;a href="1979"&gt;1979&lt;/a&gt;, yaiku produk individual, kritis, lan imajinasi puitik.
Gayane carita kebak mitos, simbol, lan alegori.
Pokok kang paling ditemeni yaiku rasa isolasi manungsa lan panggolekane ngenani sajatining urip.
