<doc id="134220" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=134220" title="Eugenio Montale">
Eugenio Montale

Eugenio Montale ya iku penyair, juru tulis prosa, edhitor, pengalihbasa Italia.
Dhèwèké lair ana &lt;a href="Genoa"&gt;Genoa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Italia"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt;, tanggal &lt;a href="12"&gt;12&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Oktober"&gt;Oktober&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1896"&gt;1896&lt;/a&gt;.
Séda ana &lt;a href="Milan"&gt;Milan&lt;/a&gt;, Italia, tanggal &lt;a href="12"&gt;12&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="September"&gt;September&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1981"&gt;1981&lt;/a&gt;.
Dhèwèké éntuk pahargyan &lt;a href="Nobel%20Sastra"&gt;Nobel Sastra&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1975"&gt;1975&lt;/a&gt;.
Sawektu isih enom, Montale dilatih dadi penyanyi opera.
Dhèwèké direkrut ana &lt;a href="Perang%20Donya%201"&gt;Perang Donya 1&lt;/a&gt;, banjur, sawisé rampung perang, dhèwèké bali sinau musik manèh.
Dhèwèké kerep mèlu kagiyatan sastra.
Taun &lt;a href="1922"&gt;1922&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké dadi salah sijining wong kang ngedhegake &lt;a href="Primo%20Tempo"&gt;Primo Tempo&lt;/a&gt;, jurnal sastra.
Taun &lt;a href="1927"&gt;1927&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1928"&gt;1928&lt;/a&gt;, makarya ana penerbit &lt;a href="Bemporad"&gt;Bemporad&lt;/a&gt;.
Dadi kepala ana &lt;a href="Gabinetto%20Vieusseux"&gt;Gabinetto Vieusseux&lt;/a&gt; ana &lt;a href="Florence"&gt;Florence&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1929"&gt;1929&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1938"&gt;1938&lt;/a&gt;.
Dadi pengalihbasa freelance lan kritikus geguritan La Fiera Letteraria taun &lt;a href="1938"&gt;1938&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1948"&gt;1948&lt;/a&gt;.
Banjur dadi edhitor basa lan esitor musik kalawarta &lt;a href="Corriere%20della%20Sera"&gt;Corriere della Sera&lt;/a&gt; ana Milan taun &lt;a href="1948"&gt;1948&lt;/a&gt;.
