Gaya mainé lan kemampuan asring disandingné karo gaya mainé legenda Brasil ya iku &lt;a href="Ronaldinho"&gt;Ronaldinho&lt;/a&gt; lan uga juru main &lt;a href="Barcelona"&gt;Barcelona&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Argentina"&gt;Argentina&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Lionel%20Messi"&gt;Lionel Messi&lt;/a&gt;.
Amarga penampilané sing apik karo Liverpool, Philippe Coutinho éntuk warna-warna pahargian ndhik taun &lt;a href="2014"&gt;2014&lt;/a&gt;/&lt;a href="2015"&gt;2015&lt;/a&gt;. Coutinho éntuk 4 gelar: Player of the Year, Players' Player of the Year, Goal of the Year (Philippe Coutinho v Southampton &lt;a href="22%20F%C3%A8bruari"&gt;22 Fèbruari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2015"&gt;2015&lt;/a&gt;), Performance of the Year (Philippe Coutinho v &lt;a href="Manchester%20City%20F.C."&gt;Manchester City&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1%20Maret"&gt;1 Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2015"&gt;2015&lt;/a&gt;). Salumrahé pemain kang péngin ngembangaké dhiri, ing taun transfer window musim 2018, Barcelona ngirim proposal kanggo ngrékrut Coutinho saka Liverpool, senadyan ta ana tarik ulur kang alot, asilé Coutinho kedadèn dadi pemain Barcelona kanthi dhuwit transfer kang larang banget yaiku 1,6 triliyun rupiah. Dadèkaké dhèwèke pemain Brasil kang duwèni transfer paling larang kaloro sawise Neymar.
