<doc id="134556" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=134556" title="Sigrid Undset">
Sigrid Undset

Sigrid Undset yaiku novelis Nurwègen.
Lair ana &lt;a href="Kalundborg"&gt;Kalundborg&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Dh%C3%A8nemarken"&gt;Dhènemarken&lt;/a&gt;, tanggal &lt;a href="20"&gt;20&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="M%C3%A8i"&gt;Mèi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1882"&gt;1882&lt;/a&gt;.
Séda ana &lt;a href="Lillehammer"&gt;Lillehammer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Nurw%C3%A8gen"&gt;Nurwègen&lt;/a&gt;, tanggal &lt;a href="10"&gt;10&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Juni"&gt;Juni&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1949"&gt;1949&lt;/a&gt;.
Dhèwèké nampa pahargyan &lt;a href="Nobel%20Sastra"&gt;Nobel Sastra&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1928"&gt;1928&lt;/a&gt;.
Bapake, &lt;a href="Ingvald%20Martin%20Undset"&gt;Ingvald Martin Undset&lt;/a&gt;, yaiku arkeologis.
Ibune asma &lt;a href="Charlotte%20Gyth%20of%20Kallundborg"&gt;Charlotte Gyth of Kallundborg&lt;/a&gt;.
Dhèwèké kapeksa lunga saka Nurwègen nalika &lt;a href="Perang%20Donya%202"&gt;Perang Donya 2&lt;/a&gt;.
Dhèwèké lunga menyang &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rika%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérika Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; nanging nerusaké dukungane ana gerakan perlawanan.
Sawisé perang, dhèwèké bali lan nampa &lt;a href="Grand%20Cross%20of%20St.%20Olav"&gt;Grand Cross of St. Olav&lt;/a&gt; kanggo tulisané lan usaha patriotike.
Ana Eleve aar terbit taun &lt;a href="1934"&gt;1934&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké nyritakake uripé nalika isih bocah.
Pengalamane lumayu saka Nazi kang nduduki Nurwègen, diterbitake basa &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt; kanthi irah-irahan Return to the Future taun &lt;a href="1942"&gt;1942&lt;/a&gt;.
