<doc id="134673" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=134673" title="Giorgos Seferis">
Giorgos Seferis

Giorgos Seferis ya iku penyair, esais, diplomat Yunani.
Lair ana &lt;a href="Smyrna"&gt;Smyrna&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Anatolia"&gt;Anatolia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kamaharajan%20Utsmani"&gt;Kamaharajan Utsmani&lt;/a&gt;, utawa saiki &lt;a href="%C4%B0zmir"&gt;İzmir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt;, tanggal &lt;a href="13"&gt;13&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Maret"&gt;Maret&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1900"&gt;1900&lt;/a&gt;.
Séda ana &lt;a href="Athena"&gt;Athena&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yunani"&gt;Yunani&lt;/a&gt;, tanggal &lt;a href="20"&gt;20&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="September"&gt;September&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1971"&gt;1971&lt;/a&gt;.
Dhèwèké nampa pahargyan &lt;a href="Nobel%20Sastra"&gt;Nobel Sastra&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1963"&gt;1963&lt;/a&gt;.
Taun &lt;a href="1918"&gt;1918&lt;/a&gt;, kulawargané pindah menyang &lt;a href="Paris"&gt;Paris&lt;/a&gt; lan dhèwèké sinau hukum ana &lt;a href="University%20of%20Paris"&gt;University of Paris&lt;/a&gt; lan ngugemi sastra.
Dhèwèké bali menyang &lt;a href="Athena"&gt;Athena&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1925"&gt;1925&lt;/a&gt;.
Taun &lt;a href="1926"&gt;1926&lt;/a&gt;, didhapuk dadi diplomat déning Kementrian Luar Negeri Yunani.
Banjur makarya ana &lt;a href="London"&gt;London&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Albania"&gt;Albania&lt;/a&gt;.
Sasuwene &lt;a href="Perang%20Donya%202"&gt;Perang Donya 2&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké mèlu Free Greek Government ana pengasingan ing &lt;a href="Crete"&gt;Crete&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mesir"&gt;Mesir&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Afrika%20Kidul"&gt;Afrika Kidul&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Italia"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt;, banjur bali kanggo mbebasake Athena taun &lt;a href="1944"&gt;1944&lt;/a&gt;.
Taun &lt;a href="1957"&gt;1957&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1962"&gt;1962&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké dadi duta Yunani ana London.
