<doc id="134679" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=134679" title="Derek Walcott">
Derek Walcott

Derek Walcott ya iku penyair lan dramawan.
Lair ana &lt;a href="Castries"&gt;Castries&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Saint%20Lucia"&gt;Saint Lucia&lt;/a&gt;, tanggal &lt;a href="30"&gt;30&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Januari"&gt;Januari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1930"&gt;1930&lt;/a&gt;.
Pakaryane njelajahi pengalaman kabudayan &lt;a href="Karibia"&gt;Karibia&lt;/a&gt;.
Dhèwèké nampa &lt;a href="Pahargyan%20Nobel%20Sastra"&gt;Pahargyan Nobel Sastra&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt;.
Pengalamane urip ana pulau vulkanik pencil, sawijining pulau kang tau dilungguhi koloni &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;, gawé pengaruh gedhé ana uripé lan pakaryane.
Simbahe ujar-ujare keturunan budak.
Bapake, pelukis cat air Bohemian, séda nalika Derek Walcott lan kembarane, Roderick, agi umur-umur bocah.
Sawisé sekolah ana &lt;a href="St.%20Mary%27s%20College"&gt;St. Mary's College&lt;/a&gt; ana pulaune, lan ana &lt;a href="University%20of%20the%20West%20Indies"&gt;University of the West Indies&lt;/a&gt; ana &lt;a href="Jamaika"&gt;Jamaika&lt;/a&gt;, Walcott menyang &lt;a href="Trinidad"&gt;Trinidad&lt;/a&gt; taun &lt;a href="1953"&gt;1953&lt;/a&gt;.
Ing kana dhèwèké makarya minangka kritikus teater lan seni.
Taun &lt;a href="1959"&gt;1959&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké ngedhegake &lt;a href="Trinidad%20Theatre%20Workshop"&gt;Trinidad Theatre Workshop&lt;/a&gt; kang nggelar lakon-lakon gaweyane.
Sawektu umur 18 taun, dhèwèké gawé pagelaran kanthi 25 geguritan.
Trobosane teka kanthi kumpulan geguritan In a Green Night taun &lt;a href="1962"&gt;1962&lt;/a&gt;.
