Ross Perot

Henry Ross Perot (#ALIH) ya iku &lt;a href="pengusaha"&gt;pengusaha&lt;/a&gt; asal &lt;a href="Texas"&gt;Texas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; kang tau nyalonake dhiri minangka Présidhèn AS ing pemilu &lt;a href="Pemilihan%20Umum%20Pr%C3%A9sidh%C3%A8n%20lan%20Wakil%20Pr%C3%A9sidh%C3%A8n%20Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat%201992"&gt;1992&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Pemilihan%20Umum%20Pr%C3%A9sidh%C3%A8n%20lan%20Wakil%20Pr%C3%A9sidh%C3%A8n%20Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat%201996"&gt;1996&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké yasa &lt;a href="Electronic%20Data%20Systems"&gt;Electronic Data Systems&lt;/a&gt; (EDS) ing taun 1962. Nalika didol marang &lt;a href="General%20Motors"&gt;General Motors&lt;/a&gt; taun 1984, EDS duwé aji AS$2,5 miliar. Perusahaan teknologi informasi &lt;a href="Perot%20Systems"&gt;Perot Systems&lt;/a&gt; diadegaké taun 1988.
