<doc id="137286" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=137286" title="City of Ember">
City of Ember

City of Ember ya iku &lt;a href="film"&gt;filem&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="fiksi%20ilmiah"&gt;fiksi ilmiah&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; kang digawé déning 20th Century Fox taun 2008 dijupuk saka novèl taun 2003 sesirah &lt;a href="The%20City%20of%20Ember"&gt;The City of Ember&lt;/a&gt; anggitané &lt;a href="Jeanne%20DuPrau"&gt;Jeanne DuPrau&lt;/a&gt;. Filem iki disutradarani &lt;a href="Gil%20Kenan"&gt;Gil Kenan&lt;/a&gt;, dhedhasar naskah anggitan &lt;a href="Caroline%20Thompson"&gt;Caroline Thompson&lt;/a&gt;. Juru arah filem iki ya iku &lt;a href="Walden%20Media"&gt;Walden Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Playtone"&gt;Playtone&lt;/a&gt;, Seth Hanchett, &lt;a href="Gary%20Goetzman"&gt;Gary Goetzman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tom%20Hanks"&gt;Tom Hanks&lt;/a&gt;, lan Steven Shareshian. Sakpérang paraga kang mèlu main ing filem iki antarané &lt;a href="Saoirse%20Ronan"&gt;Saoirse Ronan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Harry%20Treadaway"&gt;Harry Treadaway&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bill%20Murray"&gt;Bill Murray&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mackenzie%20Crook"&gt;Mackenzie Crook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Martin%20Landau"&gt;Martin Landau&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mary%20Kay%20Place"&gt;Mary Kay Place&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Toby%20Jones"&gt;Toby Jones&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Tim%20Robbins"&gt;Tim Robbins&lt;/a&gt;. Citi of Ember dibabar ing tanggal 10 Oktober, rong wulan sawisé babarané buku sambungan pungkasané: &lt;a href="The%20Diamond%20of%20Darkhold"&gt;The Diamond of Darkhold&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Ringkesan</h2>
Ringkesan.
Ing Kutha Ember anané mung wengi, tanpa ana wulan utawa lintang. Semana uga yèn awan, ora ana srengéngé utawa langit biru. Awan ya mung nalika listrik murup saka generator, lampu-lampu madhangi dalan lan omah-omah para warga kutha. Ora ana wong kang naté teka utawa lunga saka Kutha Ember. Kira-kira lawasé rong atus taun, para warga Ember kakurung ana ing pepeteng kuwi.
