<doc id="137289" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=137289" title="Taken 2">
Taken 2

Taken 2 ya iku salah sijiné &lt;a href="film"&gt;film&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="thriller"&gt;thriller&lt;/a&gt; laga saka &lt;a href="Inggris"&gt;Inggris&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Perancis"&gt;Perancis&lt;/a&gt; kang digawé ing taun &lt;a href="2012"&gt;2012&lt;/a&gt; lan disutradarani &lt;a href="Olivier%20Megaton"&gt;Olivier Megaton&lt;/a&gt;. Sing maragani filem iki antarané &lt;a href="Liam%20Neeson"&gt;Liam Neeson&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Maggie%20Grace"&gt;Maggie Grace&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Famke%20Janssen"&gt;Famke Janssen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Rade%20%C5%A0erbed%C5%BEija"&gt;Rade Šerbedžija&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Leland%20Orser"&gt;Leland Orser&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jon%20Gries"&gt;Jon Gries&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="D.%20B.%20Sweeney"&gt;D.B. Sweeney&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Luke%20Grimes"&gt;Luke Grimes&lt;/a&gt;.
Filem iki awujud sambungan kapindho awit dibabaré filem kapisan kanthi judhul sing padha, taun &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt;. Filem sing nganggo modal $ 45 yuta, iki kasil ngumpulké bathi punjul $ 376.1 nanging kurang apik panampané kanggoné para pamirsa lan kritikus. Taken 2 digawé rong taun sawisé filem kapisan, lan filem katelu, &lt;a href="Taken%203"&gt;Taken 3&lt;/a&gt;, dibabar ing tanggal 9 Januari &lt;a href="2015"&gt;2015&lt;/a&gt;.
Neruské carita ing filem kapisan, Taken 2, filem iki uga ngetokaké adegan penculikan sing membayani tumrap kaslametané kaluwargané Bryan Mills (Liam Nesson). Sawisé ayem lan mulih ing &lt;a href="Los%20Angeles"&gt;Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, Bryan lan anak wadoné, Kim (Maggie Grace) ngupadi urip kaya racaké sawisé tragedi penculikan kang ditumindakaké déning kelompok sindikat penculik.
