<doc id="137315" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=137315" title="Puteri Indonesia 2017">
Puteri Indonesia 2017

Puteri Indonesia 2017 ya iku salah sijiné adhon-adhon &lt;a href="Puteri%20Indonesia"&gt;Puteri Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; kang kaping selikur. &lt;a href="Puteri%20Indonesia%202016"&gt;Puteri Indonesia 2016&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kezia%20Roslin%20Cikita%20Warouw"&gt;Kezia Roslin Cikita Warouw&lt;/a&gt; masangké makutha marang kang menang, kang bakal makili &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt; ing adhon-adhon &lt;a href="Miss%20Universe%202017"&gt;Miss Universe 2017&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Miss%20International%202017"&gt;Miss International 2017&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Miss%20Supranational"&gt;Miss Supranational 2017&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Miss%20Grand%20International%202017"&gt;Miss Grand International 2017&lt;/a&gt;.
Adicara iki dirawuhi déning &lt;a href="Iris%20Mittenaere"&gt;Iris Mittenaere&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Miss%20Universe%202016"&gt;Miss Universe 2016&lt;/a&gt; sakai &lt;a href="Perancis"&gt;Perancis&lt;/a&gt; lan uga &lt;a href="Ariska%20Putri%20Pertiwi"&gt;Ariska Putri Pertiwi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Miss%20Grand%20International%202016"&gt;Miss Grand International 2016&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Indonesia"&gt;Indonesia&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané kuwi ana &lt;a href="Natalie%20Glebova"&gt;Natalie Glebova&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Miss%20Universe%202005"&gt;Miss Universe 2005&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Kanada"&gt;Kanada&lt;/a&gt; kang didhapuk dadi salah sijiné déwan juri.
Panyisihan Puteri Indonesia 2017 béda karo kang wis dianakaké kaya taun-taun sadurungé, ing kéné para panyarta pungkasan kang kapilih kudu nglewati 11 (10 saka pilihan dewan juri, lan siji manèh kapilih déning pamirsa televisi). Sabanjuré kuwi dipilih manèh dadi 6 (5 dipilih dé dewan juri, lan siji manèh kapilih déning pamirsa televisi). Sawisé, dipilih manèh dadi telu, loro, lan siji, nanging kabèh saka pilihané dewan juri. Adhon-adhon kuwi dimenangi déning &lt;a href="Bunga%20Jelitha%20Ibrani"&gt;Bunga Jelitha Ibrani&lt;/a&gt; kang makili &lt;a href="Jakarta"&gt;DKI Jakarta 5&lt;/a&gt;. Taun iki uga, kang mimpang diparengake mèlu adhon-adhon ing &lt;a href="Miss%20Universe%202017"&gt;Miss Universe 2017&lt;/a&gt;.
Puteri Indonesia taun iki uga dirawuhi déning sewelas pamenang taun-taun sadurungé, ya iku &lt;a href="Puteri%20Indonesia%201992"&gt;Puteri Indonesia 1992&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Indira%20Sudiro"&gt;Indira Sudiro&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Puteri%20Indonesia%201996"&gt;Puteri Indonesia 1996&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Alya%20Rohali"&gt;Alya Rohali&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Puteri%20Indonesia%202002"&gt;Puteri Indonesia 2002&lt;/a&gt; -&lt;a href="Melanie%20Putria%20Dewita%20Sari"&gt;Melanie Putria Dewita Sari&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Puteri%20Indonesia%202004"&gt;Puteri Indonesia 2004&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Artika%20Sari%20Devi"&gt;Artika Sari Devi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Puteri%20Indonesia%202005"&gt;Puteri Indonesia 2005&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Nadine%20Chandrawinata"&gt;Nadine Chandrawinata&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Puteri%20Indonesia%202006"&gt;Puteri Indonesia 2006&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Agni%20Pratistha"&gt;Agni Pratistha&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Puteri%20Indonesia%202007"&gt;Puteri Indonesia 2007&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Putri%20Raemawasti"&gt;Putri Raemawasti&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Puteri%20Indonesia%202008"&gt;Puteri Indonesia 2008&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Zivanna%20Letisha"&gt;Zivanna Letisha&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Puteri%20Indonesia%202009"&gt;Puteri Indonesia 2009&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Qory%20Sandioriva"&gt;Qory Sandioriva&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Puteri%20Indonesia%202011"&gt;Puteri Indonesia 2011&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Maria%20Selena"&gt;Maria Selena&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Puteri%20Indonesia%202012-2013"&gt;Puteri Indonesia 2012-2013&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Whulandary%20Herman"&gt;Whulandary Herman&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Puteri%20Indonesia%202014"&gt;Puteri Indonesia 2014&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Elvira%20Devinamira"&gt;Elvira Devinamira&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Puteri%20Indonesia%202015"&gt;Puteri Indonesia 2015&lt;/a&gt; - &lt;a href="Anindya%20Kusuma%20Putri"&gt;Anindya Kusuma Putri&lt;/a&gt;
