<doc id="137318" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=137318" title="Jack Turner">
Jack Turner

Jack Charles Turner (lair taun 1968; umur 58 taun) ya iku panganggit buku non-fiksi lan pamandhu adicara &lt;a href="film%20dokumenter"&gt;film dokumenter&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;. Pakaryané akèh ngrembug kajian internasional, kasujarahan, gayutan bebrayan, uga modernitas.
<h2>Riwayat</h2>
Riwayat.
Jack Charles Turner lair taun 1968 ing &lt;a href="Sydney"&gt;Sydney&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Australia"&gt;Australia&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké manggon lan bebrayan karo bojoné, Helena Fraser (lulusan saka St Antony's College, Oxford, angkatan taun 1995), anak lanangé, Oscar, sarta anak wadoné, Zoe Saffron Evie (lair 2004) lan Lola ing &lt;a href="Jenewa"&gt;Jenewa&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké uga nduwé omah ing &lt;a href="Madrid"&gt;Madrid&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tbilisi"&gt;Tbilisi&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="New%20York%20City"&gt;New York City&lt;/a&gt;.
Turner ngrampungké pendhidhikan ing pawiyatan kanti ngranggèh gelar &lt;a href="Bachelor%20of%20Arts"&gt;Bachelor of Arts&lt;/a&gt; ing Jurusan Kajian Klasik saka &lt;a href="The%20University%20of%20Melbourne"&gt;The University of Melbourne&lt;/a&gt;, nalika dadi mahasiswa resident ing &lt;a href="Trinity%20College%20%28University%20of%20Melbourne%29"&gt;Trinity College&lt;/a&gt;. Taun 1992, dhèwèké kapilih nampa beasiswa "Australia At Large" &lt;a href="Rhodes%20Scholarship"&gt;Rhodes&lt;/a&gt;, lan nglakoni pawiyatan ing &lt;a href="University%20of%20Oxford"&gt;Oxford University&lt;/a&gt;. Saliyané kuwi uga lulus taun 1994 saka &lt;a href="Magdalen%20College%2C%20Oxford"&gt;Magdalen College&lt;/a&gt; kanthi gelar &lt;a href="Master%20of%20Philosophy"&gt;Master of Philosophy&lt;/a&gt; (MPhil) ing babagan &lt;a href="International%20relations"&gt;Hubungan Internasional&lt;/a&gt;. Tesis nalika nggayuh gelar masteré sesirah Soviet New Thinking and the Cambodian Conflict dirampungke ing Departemen Pulitik lan Hubungan Internasional. Turner sabanjuré nampa gelar &lt;a href="Doctor%20of%20Philosophy"&gt;Doctor of Philosophy&lt;/a&gt; (DPhil) ing babagan Hubungan Internasional saka Oxford, kang diwènèhké déning The MacArthur Junior Research Fellowship babagan Hubungan Internasional, ing Exeter College.
<h2>Lumaku</h2>
Lumaku.
Jack Turner naté didhapuk minangka pamandhu adicara program serial dokumenter &lt;a href="What%20the%20Ancients%20Knew"&gt;What the Ancients Knew&lt;/a&gt; sing diputer ing stasiun tivi &lt;a href="The%20Science%20Channel"&gt;The Science Channel&lt;/a&gt;. Ing serial iki, dhèwèké nekani papan panggonan sing nduwéni kasujarahan ing sapérang panggonan ing donya, nyuguhaké èlmu kawruh, &lt;a href="antropologi"&gt;antropologi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="%C3%A9konomi"&gt;ékonomi&lt;/a&gt;, prakara-prakara mékanik peradaban kuna. Telung episodhe kapisan nyakup &lt;a href="Roma"&gt;Roma&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Mesir"&gt;Mesir&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Tiongkok"&gt;Tiongkok&lt;/a&gt;. Episodhe sabanjuré ngrembug &lt;a href="Jepang"&gt;Jepang&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yunani"&gt;Yunani&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt;.
