Ki Anton Surono (#ALIH) ya iku salah sawijiné &lt;a href="dhalang"&gt;dhalang&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="wayang%20kulit"&gt;wayang kulit&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="wayang%20gol%C3%A8k"&gt;wayang golèk&lt;/a&gt; saka &lt;a href="Kutha%20Tegal"&gt;Kutha Tegal&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jawa%20Tengah"&gt;Jawa Tengah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;. Anton Surono miwiti karier minangka dhalang taun &lt;a href="1987"&gt;1987&lt;/a&gt;. Dhèwèké naté dipracaya dadi duta kabudayan &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; kanthi mentasaké pakaryané ing nagara-nagara ASEAN kaya déné &lt;a href="Vietnam"&gt;Vietnam&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Singapura"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Myanmar"&gt;Myanmar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Brunei%20Darussalam"&gt;Brunei Darussalam&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Thailand"&gt;Thailand&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kamboja"&gt;Kamboja&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Laos"&gt;Laos&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;. Kaprigelané ndhalang Ki Anton Surono tumurun saka ramané, Ki Suwarto Kondobuwono, dhalang ing kala mangsa &lt;a href="1970"&gt;1970&lt;/a&gt;-an ingi &lt;a href="Tegal"&gt;Kutha Tegal&lt;/a&gt;. Anton uga naté makarya bareng karo &lt;a href="Enthus%20Susmono"&gt;Ki Enthus Susmono&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Slamet%20Gundono"&gt;Slamet Gundono&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Sujiwo%20Tedjo"&gt;Sujiwo Tedjo&lt;/a&gt;.
